extended-lsp.nvim/blob/f4ab702b5ebdaf79acf6104071a8df7cc8771fbd/lua/gdscript-extended-lsp/init.lua#L378 since `client:supports_method(\"gdscript/show_native_symbol\")` evaluates to true, but the callback function itself is never actually executed.\n\nThe bad commit d55883b4b17f29cfb831795e6d79f977104aebe2 definitely messes with the behaviour of the `GDScriptTextDocument::declaration` method in `gdscript_text_document.cpp` in some way, probably with the result being that the `notify_client_show_symbol` method (or `show_native_symbol_in_editor` if the \"Show Native Symbols in Editor\" setting is on) is never called.\n\nMaybe I should read up on how to debug Godot and take a crack at a PR myself, hah.\n\nEDIT 2: Sorry, I should probably clarify that this is all just for the \"go-to-declaration\" issue. I don't experience the issue of \"clicking on scripts or files inside Godot no longer auto-opens them in Neovim\", though I am on Fedora Linux using https://github.com/Cretezy/godot-server.nvim","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3384401917/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3390251191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111400#issuecomment-3390251191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111400","id":3390251191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KEyC3","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_